OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including orchestral
OL,8,     Gworks from the Berlin
OL,9,     GPhilharmonic and chamber music
OL,10,     Gled by Sir Antonio Pappano.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,12,     GA lifelong friendship, a papal
OL,13,     Gjubilee, and a revamped St
OL,14,     GPeter's, but also some hard-
OL,15,     Ghitting losses... Donald Macleod
OL,16,     Gsees why Palestrina is
OL,17,     Gconsidering becoming a priest.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,20,     Gmusic from Intesa Duo.
